Subject: [BW] New unfolder: unfold sketches without the GUI

getUnfoldSketches set ViewObject.DrawStyle on the bend-line sketch and
ViewObject.PointSize on the bend-label sketch unconditionally. Without
the GUI (FreeCADCmd, the release package) ViewObject is None, so an
unfold with "Generate sketch" and separate layers or bend labels failed.
edges_to_sketch_object already guards its colours with FreeCAD.GuiUp.

Upstream: shaise/FreeCAD_SheetMetal at cbf6595 (0.8.26). Offered upstream.
Applies with: patch -p1 -d package/bruceworx/vendor/SheetMetal < this file
---
--- a/SheetMetalNewUnfolder.py
+++ b/SheetMetalNewUnfolder.py
@@ -1579,7 +1579,8 @@
             existing_sketches,
             bend_sketch_color,
         )
-        bend_lines_doc_obj.ViewObject.DrawStyle = "Dashdot"
+        if bend_lines_doc_obj.ViewObject is not None:  # [BW] None without the GUI
+            bend_lines_doc_obj.ViewObject.DrawStyle = "Dashdot"
         sketch_objects_list.append(bend_lines_doc_obj)
     # Inner lines are sometimes not present.
     if inner_wires:
@@ -1607,6 +1608,7 @@
             existing_sketches,
             bend_label_color,
         )
-        bend_labels_doc_obj.ViewObject.PointSize = 0
+        if bend_labels_doc_obj.ViewObject is not None:  # [BW] None without the GUI
+            bend_labels_doc_obj.ViewObject.PointSize = 0
         sketch_objects_list.append(bend_labels_doc_obj)
     return sketch_objects_list
